registers_not_updating.description:
The Viega Fonterra module **{device}** answers, but has rejected reading these registers since {since} (Modbus exception {codes}):

{registers}

The affected values in Home Assistant are frozen at their last known state. This often follows a Viega firmware update. Check that Modbus TCP is fully enabled in the Viega app and that the module runs normally; if the problem stays, report it with *Download diagnostics* attached. This message disappears automatically once all values can be read again.
